but important parts of a greater whole. A return to self looks a lot likea reintegration - a gentle coming home to nature, to community, to the power that lives within. A rekindling of the universaltruths we’ve always known.","2:63534|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|5|Instagram story - 151","2:63544|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|5|Instagram story - 37","2:63554|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|3|Instagram story - 54","2:63562|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|3|Instagram story - 75","2:63572|0|0|1|l|0|2322|1|Request: Text graphics for feed  Due: ASAP Intention: To share our three pillars and guiding principles Slide 1: Craftsmanship - We merge time-honored traditions with modern techniques to create the highest level of quality in every piece. Inspired by classic workmanship and heritage design, our partners take pride in carefully crafting each piece to order, with a special touch that can't be replicated by machines. Slide 2: Responsibility - To minimize our environmental impact, High Light pieces are handmade to order and crafted from certified recycled solid gold, ethically sourced materials, and consciously created lab-cultured diamonds. Slide 3: Purpose - We seek to inspire you to reconnect with yourself, to delight in the natural wonders we so often overlook, to feel gratitude for the gift that is the present–with the belief that these individual actions can lead to a deeper sense of compassion for others.","2:63573|0|0|1|l|0|2322|1|Copy 1: At the core of our mission is a commitment to creating pieces that will stir your soul and invite you inward. Copy 2: To me, High Light is about the practice. The shift in mindset toward the deeper appreciation and compassion that our future requires. Copy 3: The pieces we create are simply manifestations of that mindset, made to help support that shift.","2:63574|0|0|1|l|0|2322|1|Slide 1: “At the core of our mission is a commitment to creating pieces that will stir your soul and invite you inward.” - Founder, Donnie Soddu  Slide 2: Dear reader, High Light began as a personal pursuit, a creative outlet, an escape. As a mother and person of color with a deep respect for nature, I felt a strong pull to create something hopeful and environmentally responsible. Slide 3: I decided to channel my experience in the fashion, wellness and beauty industries to create a company that combines timeless design with a sense of intentionality and care for our shared future. Slide 4: To me, High Light is about the practice. The shift in mindset toward the deeper appreciation and compassion that our future requires. Slide 5: The pieces we create are simply manifestations of that mindset, made to help support that shift. I hope they bring you pleasure and peace. — Donnie","2:63575|0|0|1|l|0|3322|1|Asset: Launch Story Set Due: ASAP Intention: To share our perspective/lifestyle we embody and encourageAsset:    Copy Quote: \"The sun, with all those planets revolving around it and dependent on it, can still ripen a bunch of grapes as if it had nothing else in the universe to do.\" - Galileo Galilei","2:63576|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|5|Instagram story - 56","2:63584|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|5|Instagram story - 57","2:63592|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|5|Instagram story - 58","2:63600|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|3|Instagram story - 152","2:63610|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|3|Instagram story - 59","2:63620|1080|1350|1|u|0|2222|3|Instagram story - 60","2:63632|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-Launch-01","2:63639|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-Launch-01","2:63646|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-Prayer-01","2:63653|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-FieldNotes","2:63664|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|7|HighLight_IGStorySet-FieldNotes","2:63679|0|0|1|l|0|2322|1|Vintage Mano Figa","2:63680|0|0|1|l|0|2322|1|Field Notes—","2:63681|0|0|1|l|0|2322|1|Field Notes","2:63682|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-FieldNotes","2:63693|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-FieldNotes","2:63704|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|7|HighLight_IGStorySet-FieldNotes","2:6